message: "If you use or adapt LDTMP, please cite it as below."
title: "LDTMP: Layered Depth Tension Modulation Protocol"
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-23
license: CC-BY-4.0
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Milovidov
    given-names: Alexander
repository-code: "https://github.com/amilovidov/ldtmp"
abstract: >-
  A protocol for pacing the emotional depth of a conversation between a person
  and an AI interviewer, using six layers, deterministic transition rules and a
  safety gate. Code decides the layer and the language model writes within it.
keywords:
  - conversational AI
  - LLM agents
  - conversation design
  - engagement signals
